 "description": "Borghans1997 - Calcium Oscillation - Model 3\nBioModels BIOMD0000000045 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000045_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 300 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000045_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: oscillating), sampling 0.3.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 3.55e-04 of species peak (worst: Z)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] 'EC' goes below zero in the SBML: integrated as EC_o = value + 1, output as EC = OUTC[EC_o;-1*source]\n  [info] v2i: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] v3i: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] v2s: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] v3s: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed",
